(332096, 25539, 656, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer this in colour.   :)<br/> <br/>Graphic shot of a common subject, seems a bit softer towards the right edge, but I like seeing lens flare from ''the other side'' for a change.  The cropped bottom jars a bit.<br/> <br/>Not sure it entirely fits ''low-key'' but is mostly black on black.</td>', 'I''d prefer this in colour.   :) Graphic shot of a common subject, seems a bit softer towards the right edge, but I like seeing lens flare from ''the other side'' for a change.  The cropped bottom jars a bit. Not sure it entirely fits ''low-key'' but is mostly black on black.', '2003-06-20 01:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
