(332322, 25260, 6349, '<td valign="top">argh.  nasty.  stop doing that.  for yourself.  it doesn''t bnther me (actually i kind of enjoy it), but come on...</td>', 'argh.  nasty.  stop doing that.  for yourself.  it doesn''t bnther me (actually i kind of enjoy it), but come on...', '2003-06-20 04:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(332323, 25433, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far.  Really good lighting.</td>', 'This is my favorite so far.  Really good lighting.', '2003-06-20 04:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(332324, 25440, 6349, '<td valign="top">this might be a tad too dark, which is a shame, since i''m sure it wasn''t and you just darkened it for this ridiculous challenge.  I''ve seen the worst shots on here yet.  This could be one of the best of them if it was just a little lighter.  I believe you can have your highlights at 30% black for lowkey, which is actually pretty light.  I''m still scoring this high, but it''s a bit of a challenge to look at it in itself!</td>', 'this might be a tad too dark, which is a shame, since i''m sure it wasn''t and you just darkened it for this ridiculous challenge.  I''ve seen the worst shots on here yet.  This could be one of the best of them if it was just a little lighter.  I believe you can have your highlights at 30% black for lowkey, which is actually pretty light.  I''m still scoring this high, but it''s a bit of a challenge to look at it in itself!', '2003-06-20 05:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(332326, 25126, 6349, '<td valign="top">I totally disagree.  However, this may be my favorite picture so far, so keep doin'' your thing!  Everyone''s got their key to life, and although yours may work for you it doesn''t necessarily mean it''s true or it will work for everyone else.  Wrong message, great photo.  Really love the lighting and the shine on the chain and the vignetting effect (did you use a flashlight or something?)</td>', 'I totally disagree.  However, this may be my favorite picture so far, so keep doin'' your thing!  Everyone''s got their key to life, and although yours may work for you it doesn''t necessarily mean it''s true or it will work for everyone else.  Wrong message, great photo.  Really love the lighting and the shine on the chain and the vignetting effect (did you use a flashlight or something?)', '2003-06-20 05:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(332328, 25480, 6349, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  It sounds like a song title.  Photo is good, just a little grainy.  Looks like it was shot at too high a film speed?</td>', 'Love the title.  It sounds like a song title.  Photo is good, just a little grainy.  Looks like it was shot at too high a film speed?', '2003-06-20 05:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
