(332589, 25440, 4285, '<td valign="top">To me this epitomizes Black on Black/Low-key. Maximum detail with minimal use of light. You could have even ligthened it up a little.  I used <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=29246&amp;PHPSESSID=6911e8707e1beb058be0e768f248b980" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">This</a> as my basis for voting. 8 (Avg. Vote Cast in Challenges to date 5.1344) Hope the link is working :)</td>', 'To me this epitomizes Black on Black/Low-key. Maximum detail with minimal use of light. You could have even ligthened it up a little.  I used This as my basis for voting. 8 (Avg. Vote Cast in Challenges to date 5.1344) Hope the link is working :)', '2003-06-20 10:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(332591, 25087, 7010, '<td valign="top">Lovely! ...but a bit too much NeatImage imho (if I''m not mistaking). The lighter ''spots'' in the down-left corner are a bit distracting. They don''t have a function in this image. The composition is very nice, I like the angle. Tones also are OK.</td>', 'Lovely! ...but a bit too much NeatImage imho (if I''m not mistaking). The lighter ''spots'' in the down-left corner are a bit distracting. They don''t have a function in this image. The composition is very nice, I like the angle. Tones also are OK.', '2003-06-20 10:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(332614, 25547, 8522, '<td valign="top">Haha, this is how I kept seeing those words... I think you may even have an SG there (albeit a copy)!<br/>Great concept, nice mood, good textures. Like the sharpness of the ''Marshall'' logo. Graininess of guitar works well. Like the cropping, and angle of guitar.<br/>My favourite pic this challenge, you met the challenge well. 9</td>', 'Haha, this is how I kept seeing those words... I think you may even have an SG there (albeit a copy)!Great concept, nice mood, good textures. Like the sharpness of the ''Marshall'' logo. Graininess of guitar works well. Like the cropping, and angle of guitar.My favourite pic this challenge, you met the challenge well. 9', '2003-06-20 10:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(332615, 25480, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great subject for challenge. Shame about the graininess, too many highlights on the boot for my taste. Otherwise, effective mood. 8</td>', 'Great subject for challenge. Shame about the graininess, too many highlights on the boot for my taste. Otherwise, effective mood. 8', '2003-06-20 10:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(332618, 25440, 8533, '<td valign="top">I''ve got my contrast and brightness ramped right up on this monitor and I can''t actually see anything in your image.</td>', 'I''ve got my contrast and brightness ramped right up on this monitor and I can''t actually see anything in your image.', '2003-06-20 10:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(332620, 25436, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a figure! Emma Peel in bondage...(!)<br/>I feel that you missed the opportunity to explore the moodiness and darkness that a low-key image could have produced, IMO there are too many highlights, and not enough exploration of the darker tones. The glares don''t work for me here. Other than that, very arresting photo! 8</td>', 'Wow, what a figure! Emma Peel in bondage...(!)I feel that you missed the opportunity to explore the moodiness and darkness that a low-key image could have produced, IMO there are too many highlights, and not enough exploration of the darker tones. The glares don''t work for me here. Other than that, very arresting photo! 8', '2003-06-20 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(332626, 24688, 8522, '<td valign="top">Stunning picture, but not low-key. 6</td>', 'Stunning picture, but not low-key. 6', '2003-06-20 10:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(332631, 25260, 8522, '<td valign="top">An apt choice for a low-key picture. However, the composition doesn''t work for me here, and I''m not sure where your focus was. I had to hunt around for the scars, to me they''re not immediately obvious. The scissors look very blunt... maybe something sharper would have added an extra ''edginess'' to this picture, and also added to it''s shock value. In all, a great idea, could be better excecuted. 6<br/>ps, I hope the cutter is okay!</td>', 'An apt choice for a low-key picture. However, the composition doesn''t work for me here, and I''m not sure where your focus was. I had to hunt around for the scars, to me they''re not immediately obvious. The scissors look very blunt... maybe something sharper would have added an extra ''edginess'' to this picture, and also added to it''s shock value. In all, a great idea, could be better excecuted. 6ps, I hope the cutter is okay!', '2003-06-20 10:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(332633, 25466, 8522, '<td valign="top">An interesting the shot, but the posterising (or similar) filter completely detracts for me. 4</td>', 'An interesting the shot, but the posterising (or similar) filter completely detracts for me. 4', '2003-06-20 10:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(332635, 24888, 8522, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting on here makes this seem less loving and more aggressive. Too much glare, to my taste there is too much contrast in this shot, and not enough exploration of the subtleties of the darker shades. 4</td>', 'The harsh lighting on here makes this seem less loving and more aggressive. Too much glare, to my taste there is too much contrast in this shot, and not enough exploration of the subtleties of the darker shades. 4', '2003-06-20 10:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(332636, 24822, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - very impressive shot.  The low-key definitely adds to the mood of the image and the mask leaps out at you with its eerie expression.  This is a really nice shot.  Perhaps a tiny bit busy up in the upper right corner - I find that a bit distracting.  But overall one of the best I''ve seen so far.  8</td>', 'Wow - very impressive shot.  The low-key definitely adds to the mood of the image and the mask leaps out at you with its eerie expression.  This is a really nice shot.  Perhaps a tiny bit busy up in the upper right corner - I find that a bit distracting.  But overall one of the best I''ve seen so far.  8', '2003-06-20 10:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(332642, 25547, 6888, '<td valign="top">Great shot, my favorite of this challenge.  The Marshall stand out very nicely and just enough lighting on the body of the guitar.  Good job.</td>', 'Great shot, my favorite of this challenge.  The Marshall stand out very nicely and just enough lighting on the body of the guitar.  Good job.', '2003-06-20 10:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(332644, 25514, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract.  I love this.  Simple lines, beautiful highlights.  Great work.  9</td>', 'Very cool abstract.  I love this.  Simple lines, beautiful highlights.  Great work.  9', '2003-06-20 10:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(332656, 25174, 6888, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Gives me the feeling of actually walking through this tunnel trying to get to the light.  Very well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Gives me the feeling of actually walking through this tunnel trying to get to the light.  Very well done.', '2003-06-20 11:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(332658, 24822, 6888, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  Although its not technically Black on Black it is still quite a striking photo.  Well done.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  Although its not technically Black on Black it is still quite a striking photo.  Well done.', '2003-06-20 11:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(332681, 25473, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a pretty nice shot. you did a good job getting it to be nice and symmetrical, though the eyes are a bit crooked. the lighting is good and works okay with the spirit of the challenge. i''d like to see a little more contrast (brighter highlights, especially in the eyes). it also looks like it may have been a tad over sharpened in post-processing. i like the crop, also. the only thing really lacking is that it doesn''t particularly convey much feeling or emotion in me. it''s kind of empty. still a good effort. 6.</td>', 'this is a pretty nice shot. you did a good job getting it to be nice and symmetrical, though the eyes are a bit crooked. the lighting is good and works okay with the spirit of the challenge. i''d like to see a little more contrast (brighter highlights, especially in the eyes). it also looks like it may have been a tad over sharpened in post-processing. i like the crop, also. the only thing really lacking is that it doesn''t particularly convey much feeling or emotion in me. it''s kind of empty. still a good effort. 6.', '2003-06-20 11:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(332683, 25174, 312, '<td valign="top">this is really nice. i love the shapes and tones here, especially the path of white coming from the window. this must be a really awesome place to be in. good job controlling the light and tones. my only (very) minor gripe is the little cyan blue line in the window. i would have edited that out. it draws my eye while i''m looking at that portion of the image. 9.</td>', 'this is really nice. i love the shapes and tones here, especially the path of white coming from the window. this must be a really awesome place to be in. good job controlling the light and tones. my only (very) minor gripe is the little cyan blue line in the window. i would have edited that out. it draws my eye while i''m looking at that portion of the image. 9.', '2003-06-20 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(332686, 25569, 312, '<td valign="top">this image doesn''t have a lot to offer. it''s mostly very dark, and while i understand that the challenge topic may have steered you in that direction, i think it really needs more contrast to make the textures pop. brighter light from the side would have helped lighten up some of the feather and show more of its contours and textures. 4.</td>', 'this image doesn''t have a lot to offer. it''s mostly very dark, and while i understand that the challenge topic may have steered you in that direction, i think it really needs more contrast to make the textures pop. brighter light from the side would have helped lighten up some of the feather and show more of its contours and textures. 4.', '2003-06-20 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(332687, 25440, 8488, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, your shot is completely black. I can see every other submission to this challenge (even Black Feather, for which I had to turn up my already-calibrated monitor), but I can''t see yours, even with Contrast and Brightness pumped all the way to 100%. Sorry, the inside of the lens cap is not a valid low-key choice. :-&gt;</td>', 'Unfortunately, your shot is completely black. I can see every other submission to this challenge (even Black Feather, for which I had to turn up my already-calibrated monitor), but I can''t see yours, even with Contrast and Brightness pumped all the way to 100%. Sorry, the inside of the lens cap is not a valid low-key choice. :->', '2003-06-20 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(332689, 25574, 312, '<td valign="top">good lighting and textures. the subject doesn''t speak a lot to me, and is almost kind of crowding the image a little too much. although i''m normally a big fan of a shallower depth of field, the slight blur at the top left corner of the object is actually detracting a bit here. maybe instead of framing the entire subject in the center, you could have gotten a bit closer and chosen an abstract detail of the locking mechanism itself. overall, a well composed shot that''s just a bit lacking in subject matter. 5.</td>', 'good lighting and textures. the subject doesn''t speak a lot to me, and is almost kind of crowding the image a little too much. although i''m normally a big fan of a shallower depth of field, the slight blur at the top left corner of the object is actually detracting a bit here. maybe instead of framing the entire subject in the center, you could have gotten a bit closer and chosen an abstract detail of the locking mechanism itself. overall, a well composed shot that''s just a bit lacking in subject matter. 5.', '2003-06-20 11:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(332690, 25363, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice portrait. i can''t really find much to say about it. good use of light and tones, well framed, good depth of field. the lighter texture of the background on the right sets apart the subject nicely and creates a nice sillhouette. there''s something i can''t put my finger on that keeps me from really loving this, but it''s definitely very well done. 9.</td>', 'this is a very nice portrait. i can''t really find much to say about it. good use of light and tones, well framed, good depth of field. the lighter texture of the background on the right sets apart the subject nicely and creates a nice sillhouette. there''s something i can''t put my finger on that keeps me from really loving this, but it''s definitely very well done. 9.', '2003-06-20 11:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(332694, 25466, 312, '<td valign="top">your digital effects are really detracting from this image. your choice of subjact matter was probably a little on the boring side and you felt the need to give more interest to the image, but it''s not working. lighting seems okay, but i can''t really tell much. it just doesn''t have the feel of a "photograph". 3.</td>', 'your digital effects are really detracting from this image. your choice of subjact matter was probably a little on the boring side and you felt the need to give more interest to the image, but it''s not working. lighting seems okay, but i can''t really tell much. it just doesn''t have the feel of a "photograph". 3.', '2003-06-20 11:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(332696, 25198, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a good idea and a good effort, but i think it falls a little short. the lighting on the glasses is good, but i think you need a little more contrast on the person. also, the cluttered backhround in the reflection is taking away from the clean lines of the glasses and making the shot seem busy. maybe trying it with a black curtain or sheet behind the person and more directional light on them would give this more punch. also, either with digital editing or lighting techniques, i''d try to get that nose piece out of the reflecting lens. good effort. 6.</td>', 'this is a good idea and a good effort, but i think it falls a little short. the lighting on the glasses is good, but i think you need a little more contrast on the person. also, the cluttered backhround in the reflection is taking away from the clean lines of the glasses and making the shot seem busy. maybe trying it with a black curtain or sheet behind the person and more directional light on them would give this more punch. also, either with digital editing or lighting techniques, i''d try to get that nose piece out of the reflecting lens. good effort. 6.', '2003-06-20 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(332697, 25560, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot!  I''m glad to see that there''s at least one other shot that, while "dark," isn''t necessarily "black."  My interpretation was that the shot should be low-key, and this meets it just fine.  I''m sure you''ll find a variety of opinions as the challenge progresses though...!</td>', 'I like it a lot!  I''m glad to see that there''s at least one other shot that, while "dark," isn''t necessarily "black."  My interpretation was that the shot should be low-key, and this meets it just fine.  I''m sure you''ll find a variety of opinions as the challenge progresses though...!', '2003-06-20 11:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(332700, 25070, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a good effort, but i think you''re lacking interest in the subject matter. also, i think maybe just a little more light to give some more contrast to the top and sides of the egg would make this a little better. for some reason, i think i''d also rather see the egg on the other side of the frame, but i''m not sure. seems less balanced the way it is. 5.</td>', 'this is a good effort, but i think you''re lacking interest in the subject matter. also, i think maybe just a little more light to give some more contrast to the top and sides of the egg would make this a little better. for some reason, i think i''d also rather see the egg on the other side of the frame, but i''m not sure. seems less balanced the way it is. 5.', '2003-06-20 11:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(332702, 24983, 312, '<td valign="top">this is really nice, but there''s a couple of things that bother me. one, i think, is the shallow depth of field. i''m usually a big fan of this technique, but i think it looks a little odd with the glass ashtray and the cigarette. the sharply focused end of the cigarette and the very nicely lit and focused smoke trail are really great parts of this image, though.<br/> <br/>maybe if you move the subject to the opposite side of the frame, the blur wouldn''t bother me as much. i think right now it''s kidn of blurring off into a hard edge of the photograph, whereas if it were on the other side it would blur off into the blackness of the background. anyway, overall a very nice effort. 7.</td>', 'this is really nice, but there''s a couple of things that bother me. one, i think, is the shallow depth of field. i''m usually a big fan of this technique, but i think it looks a little odd with the glass ashtray and the cigarette. the sharply focused end of the cigarette and the very nicely lit and focused smoke trail are really great parts of this image, though. maybe if you move the subject to the opposite side of the frame, the blur wouldn''t bother me as much. i think right now it''s kidn of blurring off into a hard edge of the photograph, whereas if it were on the other side it would blur off into the blackness of the background. anyway, overall a very nice effort. 7.', '2003-06-20 12:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(332704, 24822, 312, '<td valign="top">this is kind of spooky, but i think the netting in front kind of ruins it. if you took that off and just shot this ominous mask, i think the image would be a lot stronger. the lighting and shadows are nice. 6.</td>', 'this is kind of spooky, but i think the netting in front kind of ruins it. if you took that off and just shot this ominous mask, i think the image would be a lot stronger. the lighting and shadows are nice. 6.', '2003-06-20 12:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(332706, 24850, 312, '<td valign="top">i find two pretty basic faults in this photograph. one is that the subject matter is kind of dull. no real interest or emotion here. and two, the contrast of the image is on the low side. i think getting more light to reflect off the hands would act to further outline the shapes and contours while hiding some of the textures of the hands, which could make the image more abstract and appealing, at least to me. 5.</td>', 'i find two pretty basic faults in this photograph. one is that the subject matter is kind of dull. no real interest or emotion here. and two, the contrast of the image is on the low side. i think getting more light to reflect off the hands would act to further outline the shapes and contours while hiding some of the textures of the hands, which could make the image more abstract and appealing, at least to me. 5.', '2003-06-20 12:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(332707, 25530, 312, '<td valign="top">pictures of cameras never do much for me. this is pretty well lit and i like the contrasts it presents, but the subject is completely boring. i wish i could give you some more reasons this picture doesn''t connect with me, but i think that''s really it. 4.</td>', 'pictures of cameras never do much for me. this is pretty well lit and i like the contrasts it presents, but the subject is completely boring. i wish i could give you some more reasons this picture doesn''t connect with me, but i think that''s really it. 4.', '2003-06-20 12:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(332710, 25472, 312, '<td valign="top">i think this image is a little too busy/cluttered. when i think of low-key images, i think of simple images which convey shapes and forms using high-contrast lighting effects. this is just too cluttered up by different textures that it really doesn''t have a central point of focus to draw me in. the subject doesn''t connect with me as the viewer. also, the light is flat and the image really needs more contrast overall. 4.</td>', 'i think this image is a little too busy/cluttered. when i think of low-key images, i think of simple images which convey shapes and forms using high-contrast lighting effects. this is just too cluttered up by different textures that it really doesn''t have a central point of focus to draw me in. the subject doesn''t connect with me as the viewer. also, the light is flat and the image really needs more contrast overall. 4.', '2003-06-20 12:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(332714, 25559, 7350, '<td valign="top">Dramatic.  I like it.</td>', 'Dramatic.  I like it.', '2003-06-20 12:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(332715, 25496, 312, '<td valign="top">this is nice. simple, effective. i dig the spiral effect and how you''ve placed it''s vortex off-center. i think my only gripe would be the lack of overall contrast. i like to see more direct and contrasting light on the subject in these kinds of images. overall, good work. 7.</td>', 'this is nice. simple, effective. i dig the spiral effect and how you''ve placed it''s vortex off-center. i think my only gripe would be the lack of overall contrast. i like to see more direct and contrasting light on the subject in these kinds of images. overall, good work. 7.', '2003-06-20 12:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(332716, 25126, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice background.</td>', 'Nice background.', '2003-06-20 12:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(332720, 24819, 7350, '<td valign="top">Strange choice of subject.  Not something I would hang up, but it looks great for the challenge, anyway!  7.</td>', 'Strange choice of subject.  Not something I would hang up, but it looks great for the challenge, anyway!  7.', '2003-06-20 12:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
