(333063, 24766, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, but don''t feel it is really low-key enough. The faces are what you focus on, and they are LIGHT! I do like the shadow on the middle boy''s face. They all have great expressions, there was some good chemistry here. 7</td>', 'I love this picture, but don''t feel it is really low-key enough. The faces are what you focus on, and they are LIGHT! I do like the shadow on the middle boy''s face. They all have great expressions, there was some good chemistry here. 7', '2003-06-20 16:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
