(333077, 25239, 8171, '<td valign="top">I really like this - excellent framing and subtle gradation of coloured tones. well done -9</td>', 'I really like this - excellent framing and subtle gradation of coloured tones. well done -9', '2003-06-20 16:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(333082, 25358, 312, '<td valign="top">interesting concept and pretty well done. i''m assuming the "green breath" is a photoshop technique, because it doesn''t really seem to be a part of the photograph. actually, i kind of wonder how much of this actually is photoshop, but i guess that''s a sign of it being pretty well done, since i can''t really tell. the green border is awful, in my opinion, but the rest is pretty cool. good work. (btw, i''ve been listening to a lot of type o negative the last few days and i don''t know if you are familiar with them, but this image fits them well. heh). 7.</td>', 'interesting concept and pretty well done. i''m assuming the "green breath" is a photoshop technique, because it doesn''t really seem to be a part of the photograph. actually, i kind of wonder how much of this actually is photoshop, but i guess that''s a sign of it being pretty well done, since i can''t really tell. the green border is awful, in my opinion, but the rest is pretty cool. good work. (btw, i''ve been listening to a lot of type o negative the last few days and i don''t know if you are familiar with them, but this image fits them well. heh). 7.', '2003-06-20 16:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(333084, 25465, 312, '<td valign="top">although this is well focused and decently well lit, the subject matter really does nothing for me. i suppose you''re trying to play on "low key", but it still makes for a pretty boring photo. technically well done, except maybe for the liberal crop of the chain. 5.</td>', 'although this is well focused and decently well lit, the subject matter really does nothing for me. i suppose you''re trying to play on "low key", but it still makes for a pretty boring photo. technically well done, except maybe for the liberal crop of the chain. 5.', '2003-06-20 16:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(333085, 25392, 8171, '<td valign="top">I really lilke the concept here - framing, tones spot-on. The only thing I think could have improved it would have been the choice of tie -  80s Black Satin would have worked even better!  - well done 9</td>', 'I really lilke the concept here - framing, tones spot-on. The only thing I think could have improved it would have been the choice of tie -  80s Black Satin would have worked even better!  - well done 9', '2003-06-20 16:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(333087, 25300, 312, '<td valign="top">my primary gripe with this image is that it is a tad tilted to the right. this is so easily fixed in any photo editing software that it really makes me wonder why you didn''t. although it is very very minor so maybe you didn''t notice. the lighting here is pretty good, although i like to see more contrast in these types of images. brighter light on the one side of the candle stick and less light on the other side would serve to highlight the shapes and contours of the object. overall, a good effort. 6.</td>', 'my primary gripe with this image is that it is a tad tilted to the right. this is so easily fixed in any photo editing software that it really makes me wonder why you didn''t. although it is very very minor so maybe you didn''t notice. the lighting here is pretty good, although i like to see more contrast in these types of images. brighter light on the one side of the candle stick and less light on the other side would serve to highlight the shapes and contours of the object. overall, a good effort. 6.', '2003-06-20 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(333089, 25386, 8171, '<td valign="top">Outstanding luck you had with that corner detail. Makes an otherwise everyday shot into something quite special. - well done 9</td>', 'Outstanding luck you had with that corner detail. Makes an otherwise everyday shot into something quite special. - well done 9', '2003-06-20 16:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(333090, 25447, 8171, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and tones but I think the marbled ball surface makes the image confusing to the eye -6</td>', 'I like the idea and tones but I think the marbled ball surface makes the image confusing to the eye -6', '2003-06-20 16:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(333091, 25248, 7350, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, sharp focus, very low key.  Well done!</td>', 'Excellent detail, sharp focus, very low key.  Well done!', '2003-06-20 16:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(333093, 25496, 8171, '<td valign="top">well done on this - similar tones to another wood-grain shot I''ve just complimented someone on and just as appealling.  A top ten or even ribbon?? Here''s hoping - 9</td>', 'well done on this - similar tones to another wood-grain shot I''ve just complimented someone on and just as appealling.  A top ten or even ribbon?? Here''s hoping - 9', '2003-06-20 16:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
