(333097, 25440, 8171, '<td valign="top">Sorry - possibilities here but much too dark for me - 5</td>', 'Sorry - possibilities here but much too dark for me - 5', '2003-06-20 16:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(333099, 25248, 8171, '<td valign="top">Nice and detailed macro work that really draws the eye but IMHO I would have preferred the area around to have been completely dark - 7</td>', 'Nice and detailed macro work that really draws the eye but IMHO I would have preferred the area around to have been completely dark - 7', '2003-06-20 16:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(333103, 25522, 312, '<td valign="top">this more or less feels like a snapshot to me. the lighting is pretty flat and doesn''t offer much contrast on the cat''s hair. overall i just don''t find the image very interesting. 4.</td>', 'this more or less feels like a snapshot to me. the lighting is pretty flat and doesn''t offer much contrast on the cat''s hair. overall i just don''t find the image very interesting. 4.', '2003-06-20 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(333107, 24908, 312, '<td valign="top">lighting and focus are good, and the fact that the object is centered in the frame seems to work okay here. i think the only thing that bothers me is that the watch is on its side. i think it makes me want to tilt my head to see what''s going on. i''d rather see a vertical shot, and without the velvet textures below it. 5.</td>', 'lighting and focus are good, and the fact that the object is centered in the frame seems to work okay here. i think the only thing that bothers me is that the watch is on its side. i think it makes me want to tilt my head to see what''s going on. i''d rather see a vertical shot, and without the velvet textures below it. 5.', '2003-06-20 16:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(333109, 25241, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot. the tones and textures of the smoke are really cool. i''m not so sure about the placement of the incense stick, jutting into the photo in the corner like that, but the smoke really makes it. lighting and focus are very nice. good job. 7.</td>', 'this is a nice shot. the tones and textures of the smoke are really cool. i''m not so sure about the placement of the incense stick, jutting into the photo in the corner like that, but the smoke really makes it. lighting and focus are very nice. good job. 7.', '2003-06-20 16:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(333115, 25126, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a strong image. the lighting is nice, almost like it was painted on to certain areas of the photo. only a couple of things bother me - the fact that the chains seeps into the border is kind of destracting, and also the loss of detail in the chain in the upper right corner. i''d rather see the chain stream out of the image instead of bunching up in the corner like that. the light reflecting off of the chain up there seems to become just a jumble of white specks and it detracts from the strong subject. a very good effort that could just use a little cleaning up. 7.</td>', 'this is a strong image. the lighting is nice, almost like it was painted on to certain areas of the photo. only a couple of things bother me - the fact that the chains seeps into the border is kind of destracting, and also the loss of detail in the chain in the upper right corner. i''d rather see the chain stream out of the image instead of bunching up in the corner like that. the light reflecting off of the chain up there seems to become just a jumble of white specks and it detracts from the strong subject. a very good effort that could just use a little cleaning up. 7.', '2003-06-20 16:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(333138, 25528, 312, '<td valign="top">the textures and lighting in this image really create a striking mood. the subject matter is for the most part boring, but it creates such nice play with the light that it creates a lot to look at. nice crisp focus really makes this work. good job. 7.</td>', 'the textures and lighting in this image really create a striking mood. the subject matter is for the most part boring, but it creates such nice play with the light that it creates a lot to look at. nice crisp focus really makes this work. good job. 7.', '2003-06-20 16:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(333143, 25516, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a good attempt at making an interesting sillhouette, but i think overall the image is too dark. i''d like to see some more contrast between the light areas and the subject to really make the subject pop out. also, it seems a tad soft on the focus. i think this needs to be really sharp in order to work. good effort. 5.</td>', 'this is a good attempt at making an interesting sillhouette, but i think overall the image is too dark. i''d like to see some more contrast between the light areas and the subject to really make the subject pop out. also, it seems a tad soft on the focus. i think this needs to be really sharp in order to work. good effort. 5.', '2003-06-20 16:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(333150, 25539, 312, '<td valign="top">i don''t care for the subject matter here, as i really dislike pictures of cameras and camera equipment, but you''ve done a really good job capturing the light and contrast in and around the lens. the play of the light on the lens is really what makes this look good. i also like the framing and the tight crop on the bottom. good work. 7.</td>', 'i don''t care for the subject matter here, as i really dislike pictures of cameras and camera equipment, but you''ve done a really good job capturing the light and contrast in and around the lens. the play of the light on the lens is really what makes this look good. i also like the framing and the tight crop on the bottom. good work. 7.', '2003-06-20 17:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(333155, 25560, 312, '<td valign="top">this is very nice. the sepia tones are working well here, and the diagonal composition of the hammer is nice. i feel like maybe a little more negative space would help balance this big hulking hammer, which really feels like it''s overfilling the frame even though it technically isn''t (if that makes any sense). perhaps just a tad too symmetical, as well. overall though, really well shot. 7.</td>', 'this is very nice. the sepia tones are working well here, and the diagonal composition of the hammer is nice. i feel like maybe a little more negative space would help balance this big hulking hammer, which really feels like it''s overfilling the frame even though it technically isn''t (if that makes any sense). perhaps just a tad too symmetical, as well. overall though, really well shot. 7.', '2003-06-20 17:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(333159, 25565, 312, '<td valign="top">yeah, this is really nice. the soft focus effects give this a very ghostly feel, and the tones just add too it. i love the selective light that really brightens up the center part of this. possibly my only gripe is that, after all, it is just a shot of some leaves with little else really giving it any impact, but the mood is such that it really works. good job. 8.</td>', 'yeah, this is really nice. the soft focus effects give this a very ghostly feel, and the tones just add too it. i love the selective light that really brightens up the center part of this. possibly my only gripe is that, after all, it is just a shot of some leaves with little else really giving it any impact, but the mood is such that it really works. good job. 8.', '2003-06-20 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333258, 25463, 3469, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well executed, but the picture is missing something that hits you.</td>', 'Nice idea and well executed, but the picture is missing something that hits you.', '2003-06-20 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
