(333262, 24878, 3469, '<td valign="top">Great mood captured.</td>', 'Great mood captured.', '2003-06-20 18:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(333271, 24878, 7969, '<td valign="top">well, sorry i can''t vote, but i think this is a stellar image.  He reminds me of an ivan albright painting, yet done in photo.  The lighting, title, expression on his face all want me to keep looking at.   You have captured a mood very very well.  thanks for the privledge of viewing it.</td>', 'well, sorry i can''t vote, but i think this is a stellar image.  He reminds me of an ivan albright painting, yet done in photo.  The lighting, title, expression on his face all want me to keep looking at.   You have captured a mood very very well.  thanks for the privledge of viewing it.', '2003-06-20 18:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(333276, 25422, 3469, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, but I wouldn''t consider this low-key.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, but I wouldn''t consider this low-key.', '2003-06-20 19:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(333277, 24902, 7969, '<td valign="top">I am curious as to what this is. Is it a sculpture or a mask of sorts?  I like the lighting on it.</td>', 'I am curious as to what this is. Is it a sculpture or a mask of sorts?  I like the lighting on it.', '2003-06-20 19:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(333286, 25126, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is the first photo that I got on the vote page, and I really like it!  Composition works pretty well for me, though maybe just a bit too much  neg spc on the left side - but it doesn''t bother me that much; lighting is nice-gives it kind of a mysterious feel.  I love your choice of subject.</td>', 'This is the first photo that I got on the vote page, and I really like it!  Composition works pretty well for me, though maybe just a bit too much  neg spc on the left side - but it doesn''t bother me that much; lighting is nice-gives it kind of a mysterious feel.  I love your choice of subject.', '2003-06-20 19:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(333290, 25198, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but everything is just a bit too fuzzy for my taste.  I would like to be able to discern a little more of what I am looking at.  Love the shades of black/grey, and interesting composition.</td>', 'I like the concept, but everything is just a bit too fuzzy for my taste.  I would like to be able to discern a little more of what I am looking at.  Love the shades of black/grey, and interesting composition.', '2003-06-20 19:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(333291, 24878, 7778, '<td valign="top">I''m returning here after viewing all entries. <br/>This remarkable photograph is my decided choice for blue ribbon.<br/> <br/>It appeals to me very strongly, most of all for the human interest and the sense on the part of its author to ''see and freeze the moment'' with such sensitivity and precision. The technical elements (the sensitive and sparse side light highlighting little more than is necessary, the eye-level perspective and ''conversational'' distance, the composition dynamic ''left in'' the picture by allowing for a wider shot etc.) given here are entirely subordinated to the ''gist and whole'' of the picture, which, it appears, cannot be incidental. <br/> <br/>The title is simple and poetically apt to a degree I would never expect in the context of this challenge.<br/> <br/>I commend the photographer for such a rare ''transport''.</td>', 'I''m returning here after viewing all entries. This remarkable photograph is my decided choice for blue ribbon. It appeals to me very strongly, most of all for the human interest and the sense on the part of its author to ''see and freeze the moment'' with such sensitivity and precision. The technical elements (the sensitive and sparse side light highlighting little more than is necessary, the eye-level perspective and ''conversational'' distance, the composition dynamic ''left in'' the picture by allowing for a wider shot etc.) given here are entirely subordinated to the ''gist and whole'' of the picture, which, it appears, cannot be incidental.  The title is simple and poetically apt to a degree I would never expect in the context of this challenge. I commend the photographer for such a rare ''transport''.', '2003-06-20 19:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(333292, 25433, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like the composition and subject.</td>', 'Nice job.  I like the composition and subject.', '2003-06-20 19:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333295, 25260, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well, hardly a  ''light'' shot.  I feel like  I should comment more on the subject than on the techniques of the photo.  Cutting is a serious thing.  Strikes me that subject must feel desperate for relief.  I am concerned,</td>', 'Well, hardly a  ''light'' shot.  I feel like  I should comment more on the subject than on the techniques of the photo.  Cutting is a serious thing.  Strikes me that subject must feel desperate for relief.  I am concerned,', '2003-06-20 19:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(333296, 25560, 2553, '<td valign="top">Indeed, an interesting shot.  The lighting is what really makes this photo work for me.  I love the way the subject "fades" in and out of the dark areas, kind of making your mind fill in the blank areas.  The composition is very nice, and the texture of your subject adds a wonderful dimension to the shot.</td>', 'Indeed, an interesting shot.  The lighting is what really makes this photo work for me.  I love the way the subject "fades" in and out of the dark areas, kind of making your mind fill in the blank areas.  The composition is very nice, and the texture of your subject adds a wonderful dimension to the shot.', '2003-06-20 19:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(333298, 25087, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice way of meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Nice way of meeting the challenge.', '2003-06-20 19:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(333299, 25520, 714, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  I love the faces pointing at each other. It actually looks like the are making eye contact.  Cool. Lighting is awesome.  Fits the challenge well!  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent shot.  I love the faces pointing at each other. It actually looks like the are making eye contact.  Cool. Lighting is awesome.  Fits the challenge well!  Good luck!', '2003-06-20 19:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333300, 24850, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nicely done for the challenge.  Composition works, and the lighting is nice, however kind of "low impact" for me.</td>', 'Nicely done for the challenge.  Composition works, and the lighting is nice, however kind of "low impact" for me.', '2003-06-20 19:16:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(333302, 25239, 714, '<td valign="top">It fits the challenge, but I think you could have got up a little closer on the sign..would have made it more interesting.  Good luck</td>', 'It fits the challenge, but I think you could have got up a little closer on the sign..would have made it more interesting.  Good luck', '2003-06-20 19:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333303, 25578, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really would have liked to have seen this a little closer up, and/or cropped down some.  Way too much neg spc for my taste, and also a bit fuzzy.  I do love the night scene, and the way the lights of the plant look.</td>', 'I really would have liked to have seen this a little closer up, and/or cropped down some.  Way too much neg spc for my taste, and also a bit fuzzy.  I do love the night scene, and the way the lights of the plant look.', '2003-06-20 19:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(333304, 24927, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot and fits the challenge well.  I love the shadowing on the hands of the clock.  Great lighting. Good luck. I sure hope your not getting hammered for this.</td>', 'Great shot and fits the challenge well.  I love the shadowing on the hands of the clock.  Great lighting. Good luck. I sure hope your not getting hammered for this.', '2003-06-20 19:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333306, 25561, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot!  Wish I could see more of the eyes!!!  I like your composition very much, and of course, the subject.</td>', 'This is such a cool shot!  Wish I could see more of the eyes!!!  I like your composition very much, and of course, the subject.', '2003-06-20 19:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(333307, 25363, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Great shadows.  Tells a story.  Good lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Great shadows.  Tells a story.  Good lighting.  Good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(333308, 25422, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this as a portrait, but there isn''t enough shadow on her lovely face to really be considered low-key, black on black. I''m sure she''s happy with this fine portrait though.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like this as a portrait, but there isn''t enough shadow on her lovely face to really be considered low-key, black on black. I''m sure she''s happy with this fine portrait though. ', '2003-06-20 19:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333309, 25516, 714, '<td valign="top">hmmm..not sure I like the background, maybe try to shine the light on your back and not the backdrop.  Cool pose, good luck.</td>', 'hmmm..not sure I like the background, maybe try to shine the light on your back and not the backdrop.  Cool pose, good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(333313, 25300, 714, '<td valign="top">Definitly meets the challenge.  but the subject is a not very interesting.  Nice lighting and great framing.  Good luck.</td>', 'Definitly meets the challenge.  but the subject is a not very interesting.  Nice lighting and great framing.  Good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(333314, 25539, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot works well for meeting the challenge, however is pretty low impact for me.  I don''t find the subject to be particularly interesting, and  I am not crazy about the composition of the subject in the frame.  I like that it is off-center, but not the way the lower edge is out of the frame - makes the composition feel somewhat unbalanced for me.  I would have much preferred to see it composed so that there was more than one edge out of the frame.</td>', 'This shot works well for meeting the challenge, however is pretty low impact for me.  I don''t find the subject to be particularly interesting, and  I am not crazy about the composition of the subject in the frame.  I like that it is off-center, but not the way the lower edge is out of the frame - makes the composition feel somewhat unbalanced for me.  I would have much preferred to see it composed so that there was more than one edge out of the frame.', '2003-06-20 19:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(333315, 25135, 714, '<td valign="top">This does meet the challenge but not very interesting. Way to much black going on here.  A little more light would help. Good luck</td>', 'This does meet the challenge but not very interesting. Way to much black going on here.  A little more light would help. Good luck', '2003-06-20 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333321, 25472, 2553, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this a while to try to distinguish the different textures/things in the shot.  Overall, this shot seems to be pretty much all in the same tonal range, making it all kind of "run together".  There are a few dark areas in there, but definitely not enough contrast in the shot to suit me.  The flower (I think?!) is the only thing that stands out at all for me, and I do like that part of the shot.  I would like to have seen this with a stronger oblique light source that maybe would have given it more depth.</td>', 'I had to look at this a while to try to distinguish the different textures/things in the shot.  Overall, this shot seems to be pretty much all in the same tonal range, making it all kind of "run together".  There are a few dark areas in there, but definitely not enough contrast in the shot to suit me.  The flower (I think?!) is the only thing that stands out at all for me, and I do like that part of the shot.  I would like to have seen this with a stronger oblique light source that maybe would have given it more depth.', '2003-06-20 19:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(333323, 25421, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the concept very much.  Would like to have seen her eyes looking away from the camera, and also would have liked to have seen it in black and white.</td>', 'I like the concept very much.  Would like to have seen her eyes looking away from the camera, and also would have liked to have seen it in black and white.', '2003-06-20 19:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333325, 25480, 2553, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot, though it kind of made me laugh. I once did a shot with only one shoe in it, and had comments about wishing both shoes had been in the shot (I only HAD the one shoe!)  Anyway - now I know what they were talking about.  I really would like to see both boots!  I love the way this was done - lighting is great and the composition works well for me, but it just doesn''t seem natural to be only seeing 1 boot!</td>', 'Really like this shot, though it kind of made me laugh. I once did a shot with only one shoe in it, and had comments about wishing both shoes had been in the shot (I only HAD the one shoe!)  Anyway - now I know what they were talking about.  I really would like to see both boots!  I love the way this was done - lighting is great and the composition works well for me, but it just doesn''t seem natural to be only seeing 1 boot!', '2003-06-20 19:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(333326, 24749, 714, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot!!!  I love it.  Kind of spooky. Makes my hair stand on end.  Good lighting and it sure meets the challenge well.  Woooo!!!  Freaky! Vote 9</td>', 'Incredible shot!!!  I love it.  Kind of spooky. Makes my hair stand on end.  Good lighting and it sure meets the challenge well.  Woooo!!!  Freaky! Vote 9', '2003-06-20 19:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(333330, 25577, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, who''d have thought you could make a phone look so interesting!  Very nice lighting and composition.</td>', 'Wow, who''d have thought you could make a phone look so interesting!  Very nice lighting and composition.', '2003-06-20 19:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(333331, 25436, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the whole challenge.  I hope it wins!</td>', 'This is my favorite of the whole challenge.  I hope it wins!', '2003-06-20 19:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(333332, 24902, 7350, '<td valign="top">This has to be a statue.  The lighting is perfect.  I love it. 10.</td>', 'This has to be a statue.  The lighting is perfect.  I love it. 10.', '2003-06-20 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(333333, 25440, 714, '<td valign="top">This is to dark. I see the girl and it would have been a cool shot if you lightened it up a bit.  Don''t give up. Keep shooting.</td>', 'This is to dark. I see the girl and it would have been a cool shot if you lightened it up a bit.  Don''t give up. Keep shooting.', '2003-06-20 19:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(333334, 25473, 7350, '<td valign="top">Some are probably saying that this isn''t black on black.  I think it''s very "low key," though.  I really like the whole thing.  It just seems a tiny bit tilted.  I give it a 9.</td>', 'Some are probably saying that this isn''t black on black.  I think it''s very "low key," though.  I really like the whole thing.  It just seems a tiny bit tilted.  I give it a 9.', '2003-06-20 19:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(333335, 25463, 714, '<td valign="top">I think you took this challenge to the extreme. ;-)  Not very interesting. sorry</td>', 'I think you took this challenge to the extreme. ;-)  Not very interesting. sorry', '2003-06-20 19:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(333336, 24770, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty neat shot, but oddly enough, I find the tree kind of distracting.  I keep thinking how great that angel would look against an all black background.  Love the lighting.</td>', 'This is a pretty neat shot, but oddly enough, I find the tree kind of distracting.  I keep thinking how great that angel would look against an all black background.  Love the lighting.', '2003-06-20 19:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(333338, 25062, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and meets the challenge. It seems like the jacks are out of focus. Not as clear as I would like it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool idea and meets the challenge. It seems like the jacks are out of focus. Not as clear as I would like it.  Good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333340, 25241, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like it!  Smoke can be intriguing!</td>', 'I like it!  Smoke can be intriguing!', '2003-06-20 19:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(333341, 24766, 714, '<td valign="top">This picture sure tells a story .  I like that.   Lighting is good, maybe to much light on the girl in the forgrounds face.  Good luck.</td>', 'This picture sure tells a story .  I like that.   Lighting is good, maybe to much light on the girl in the forgrounds face.  Good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(333342, 25447, 714, '<td valign="top">This shot just does nothing for me. It meets the challenge though.  Good luck. :-)</td>', 'This shot just does nothing for me. It meets the challenge though.  Good luck. :-)', '2003-06-20 19:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(333343, 25530, 2553, '<td valign="top">NICE!  And I don''t just mean the equipment!  Very nicely done shot - the lighting is wonderful, highlighting just enough of the subject to make it interesting.  Composition works well for me, but I wouldn''t have minded and even closer up shot with just the tiniest bit of the subject fading out of the edges of the frame.</td>', 'NICE!  And I don''t just mean the equipment!  Very nicely done shot - the lighting is wonderful, highlighting just enough of the subject to make it interesting.  Composition works well for me, but I wouldn''t have minded and even closer up shot with just the tiniest bit of the subject fading out of the edges of the frame.', '2003-06-20 19:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(333344, 24822, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!  I love the vail. it gives it great depth.  The lighting is very dramatic. There is just one thing that bugs me, the pearls at the top right hand corner.  Good luck<br/></td>', 'Great shot!!  I love the vail. it gives it great depth.  The lighting is very dramatic. There is just one thing that bugs me, the pearls at the top right hand corner.  Good luck', '2003-06-20 19:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(333345, 25530, 714, '<td valign="top">This sure meets the challenge, but it is not very interesting to look at.  Great lighting and focus. good luck.</td>', 'This sure meets the challenge, but it is not very interesting to look at.  Great lighting and focus. good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(333347, 25386, 1280, '<td valign="top">Quite funny!  Well done too.  Congrats,  and good luck.</td>', 'Quite funny!  Well done too.  Congrats,  and good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(333348, 24893, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is certainly low-key, but I just don''t know about "Black on Black" - however, it is a very cool shot.  I don''t see how the composition could be any better, and I love the bit of light reflection in the foreground.  Has a very mysterious feel to it.  Scoring it as if it meets the challenge, cause frankly, I don''t really care if it doesn''t!  It''s nice!</td>', 'This is certainly low-key, but I just don''t know about "Black on Black" - however, it is a very cool shot.  I don''t see how the composition could be any better, and I love the bit of light reflection in the foreground.  Has a very mysterious feel to it.  Scoring it as if it meets the challenge, cause frankly, I don''t really care if it doesn''t!  It''s nice!', '2003-06-20 19:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(333349, 24902, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good one.  Meets challenge,  yet allows detail to be seen.</td>', 'Good one.  Meets challenge,  yet allows detail to be seen.', '2003-06-20 19:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(333350, 25333, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the hatband!  I really like that I can barely make out the edges of the hat.  I would have preferred a more dynamic composition I think - I find this composition to be a bit low impact for me.</td>', 'Love the hatband!  I really like that I can barely make out the edges of the hat.  I would have preferred a more dynamic composition I think - I find this composition to be a bit low impact for me.', '2003-06-20 19:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(333351, 24891, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good shot but not low-key nor black on black.  Cute though.</td>', 'Good shot but not low-key nor black on black.  Cute though.', '2003-06-20 19:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333353, 25539, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I love the lights reflection in the lens.  Makes me want to see beyond it.  Nice focus and meets the challenge well.  Good luck.<br/></td>', 'Nice shot.  I love the lights reflection in the lens.  Makes me want to see beyond it.  Nice focus and meets the challenge well.  Good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(333354, 25070, 2553, '<td valign="top">COOL!  Totally love it.   Good lighting, I can even make out the other side of the egg cup a bit.  Love your choice of composition - at first thought there was a little too much neg spc, but nope, it looks good.</td>', 'COOL!  Totally love it.   Good lighting, I can even make out the other side of the egg cup a bit.  Love your choice of composition - at first thought there was a little too much neg spc, but nope, it looks good.', '2003-06-20 19:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(333355, 24893, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice and serene.</td>', 'Nice and serene.', '2003-06-20 19:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(333357, 25036, 714, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit off on the man.  Not sure why.  I like your idea but maybe put the lighting more towards the side to create more shadows.  Good luck.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit off on the man.  Not sure why.  I like your idea but maybe put the lighting more towards the side to create more shadows.  Good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(333358, 25560, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  I love the tones here.  Very old hammer I see.  It meets the challenge for me.  Good luck</td>', 'Cool shot!  I love the tones here.  Very old hammer I see.  It meets the challenge for me.  Good luck', '2003-06-20 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(333360, 25561, 1280, '<td valign="top">ahhhhhh.... I had to look for a while before seeing the cat.  I really didn''t know what I was looking at.  I like it very much.  A wonderful abstract.  Nice!  Real nice!!!</td>', 'ahhhhhh.... I had to look for a while before seeing the cat.  I really didn''t know what I was looking at.  I like it very much.  A wonderful abstract.  Nice!  Real nice!!!', '2003-06-20 19:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(333361, 25386, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a truly freaky shot!!  I mean don''t get me wrong, I love the harbor shot, but then there''s that tiny little almost "moon" shot down there!  Had me and my husband laughing, I''ll tell you!  I truly love the harbor shot, the lighting and composition are lovely, but I''m giving you a pretty high score just for weirdness!</td>', 'What a truly freaky shot!!  I mean don''t get me wrong, I love the harbor shot, but then there''s that tiny little almost "moon" shot down there!  Had me and my husband laughing, I''ll tell you!  I truly love the harbor shot, the lighting and composition are lovely, but I''m giving you a pretty high score just for weirdness!', '2003-06-20 19:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(333362, 25070, 714, '<td valign="top">Great egg shot..maybe a little more lighting to give us more detail but not much.  I like how you centered the egg.  Looks very lonely.  good luck</td>', 'Great egg shot..maybe a little more lighting to give us more detail but not much.  I like how you centered the egg.  Looks very lonely.  good luck', '2003-06-20 19:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(333363, 25333, 714, '<td valign="top">This would have been an interesting shot, but it looks like you forgot to use lighting to create a dramatic photo.  Just my opinion.  Try setting up the lighting on the left side of the hat and setting your exposure to -2 and then shooting.  good luck.</td>', 'This would have been an interesting shot, but it looks like you forgot to use lighting to create a dramatic photo.  Just my opinion.  Try setting up the lighting on the left side of the hat and setting your exposure to -2 and then shooting.  good luck.', '2003-06-20 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(333396, 24908, 1280, '<td valign="top">Like an advertisement in a glossy magazine!. Good job!</td>', 'Like an advertisement in a glossy magazine!. Good job!', '2003-06-20 20:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(333399, 25471, 8953, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of this shot as well as the definition of the model one of my favorites Thanks 9</td>', 'I like the framing of this shot as well as the definition of the model one of my favorites Thanks 9', '2003-06-20 20:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(333401, 25563, 8953, '<td valign="top">Just a bit more centered would have made this even better. 7</td>', 'Just a bit more centered would have made this even better. 7', '2003-06-20 20:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(333404, 24749, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good job...one of the best for this challenge.</td>', 'Very good job...one of the best for this challenge.', '2003-06-20 20:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(333416, 24878, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Shows character.</td>', 'Very nice!  Shows character.', '2003-06-20 21:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(333418, 25259, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, with good lines and just enough detail.</td>', 'Nice composition, with good lines and just enough detail.', '2003-06-20 21:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(333422, 25520, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good job!</td>', 'Very good job!', '2003-06-20 21:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(333423, 25174, 7242, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous and a great example of low key. My favorite of the challenge. 10!</td>', 'This is gorgeous and a great example of low key. My favorite of the challenge. 10!', '2003-06-20 21:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(333425, 25565, 7242, '<td valign="top">So pretty. 10</td>', 'So pretty. 10', '2003-06-20 21:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333449, 25126, 1280, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective, nice!</td>', 'Simple, effective, nice!', '2003-06-20 21:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(333510, 25174, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice - one of my favourites.  I love the bricks in the arches, and the lights on the floor.</td>', 'Very nice - one of my favourites.  I love the bricks in the arches, and the lights on the floor.', '2003-06-20 22:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(333511, 25363, 5112, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that this is pretty good for low-key.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'It seems to me that this is pretty good for low-key.  One of my favourites.', '2003-06-20 22:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(333513, 25433, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good example of low-key.  One of my favourites.  (Nothing to complain!)</td>', 'Good example of low-key.  One of my favourites.  (Nothing to complain!)', '2003-06-20 22:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(333516, 25126, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  It''s neat how you kept the sparkles of the chain in the border.  I like the background for the cross.  Not much to complain here.</td>', 'I like this picture.  It''s neat how you kept the sparkles of the chain in the border.  I like the background for the cross.  Not much to complain here.', '2003-06-20 22:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(333518, 24893, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very good example of low-key.  I like this picture.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'I think this is a very good example of low-key.  I like this picture.  One of my favourites.', '2003-06-20 22:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(333522, 25440, 5112, '<td valign="top">I can see the face of the child, but barely.  I''m sure you''re hearing a lot of "too dark" comments, so I''m not going to pitch in.  The expression on the child''s face is very nice, like a "little thinker".</td>', 'I can see the face of the child, but barely.  I''m sure you''re hearing a lot of "too dark" comments, so I''m not going to pitch in.  The expression on the child''s face is very nice, like a "little thinker".', '2003-06-20 22:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(333547, 25174, 7778, '<td valign="top">Although I find this image quite dark (leaving the eye preciously little textural detail to feast on), it remains one of the most striking ones in the challenge.<br/> <br/>The chosen (or found) subject alone is without doubt worth more than a fleeting look. I like the simple adaption of the architectoral structure (i.e. the form of the arch) into the composition and the skillfull balancing of relative weight in the foregound (the expanse of the dark on the left vs. the but ''riveting'' light inside the smaller, perspective gate as well as in the stepped up shutters toward the viewer). The light and the dark, again, are linked perfectly in respective one and two thirds, but this time leading the eye back instead forwards. Definitely a piece fit for exquisite pleasure ''and'' study.<br/> <br/>Thank you.</td>', 'Although I find this image quite dark (leaving the eye preciously little textural detail to feast on), it remains one of the most striking ones in the challenge. The chosen (or found) subject alone is without doubt worth more than a fleeting look. I like the simple adaption of the architectoral structure (i.e. the form of the arch) into the composition and the skillfull balancing of relative weight in the foregound (the expanse of the dark on the left vs. the but ''riveting'' light inside the smaller, perspective gate as well as in the stepped up shutters toward the viewer). The light and the dark, again, are linked perfectly in respective one and two thirds, but this time leading the eye back instead forwards. Definitely a piece fit for exquisite pleasure ''and'' study. Thank you.', '2003-06-20 22:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(333551, 25466, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool texture, I like it.</td>', 'Cool texture, I like it.', '2003-06-20 22:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(333556, 25522, 7707, '<td valign="top">low key imo needs to have side or back lighting.  The use of flash masks the fast this was to be low key.  It does fit the black on black however.</td>', 'low key imo needs to have side or back lighting.  The use of flash masks the fast this was to be low key.  It does fit the black on black however.', '2003-06-20 23:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(333707, 24983, 7556, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the smoke...</td>', 'Great capture of the smoke...', '2003-06-21 01:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(333709, 25428, 7556, '<td valign="top">great depth of field &amp; composition...</td>', 'great depth of field & composition...', '2003-06-21 01:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(333719, 24893, 7556, '<td valign="top">Love the blue tint of the photograph...what part of the Ohio river? I grew up on the Ohio, small town called Proctorville...right across from Huntington, WV...<br/>Lovely photo, great job!<br/>JB</td>', 'Love the blue tint of the photograph...what part of the Ohio river? I grew up on the Ohio, small town called Proctorville...right across from Huntington, WV...Lovely photo, great job!JB', '2003-06-21 01:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(333720, 24946, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb. Just fantastic! I love this shot. Let me know if you sell a print of it! All elements combine here into a fantastic photo! 10</td>', 'Superb. Just fantastic! I love this shot. Let me know if you sell a print of it! All elements combine here into a fantastic photo! 10', '2003-06-21 01:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(333721, 25496, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful patterns and lines. this works well in low key! 9</td>', 'Wonderful patterns and lines. this works well in low key! 9', '2003-06-21 01:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
