(334494, 25174, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely one of my favorites!  Very mysterious and "other-worldly", this shot just draws me in.  Almost creepy, and yet makes you want to know more.  Can''t imagine a better shot for the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely one of my favorites!  Very mysterious and "other-worldly", this shot just draws me in.  Almost creepy, and yet makes you want to know more.  Can''t imagine a better shot for the challenge.', '2003-06-22 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(334498, 25563, 2553, '<td valign="top">There is another shot of boots, or rather, A boot, and I commented to them that I wish both boots had been in the shot!  I like this shot, your focus is wonderful, but the composition is lacking something for me.  I would have liked to have seen something a little more dynamic.  I think the shot works very well for the challenge.</td>', 'There is another shot of boots, or rather, A boot, and I commented to them that I wish both boots had been in the shot!  I like this shot, your focus is wonderful, but the composition is lacking something for me.  I would have liked to have seen something a little more dynamic.  I think the shot works very well for the challenge.', '2003-06-22 00:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(334499, 25547, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the guitar part of the shot, but would have been happier to see the word left out, and all the focus put on the guitar as the subject of the shot.</td>', 'I love the guitar part of the shot, but would have been happier to see the word left out, and all the focus put on the guitar as the subject of the shot.', '2003-06-22 00:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(334500, 24766, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is just a very cool shot.  Love the "setup", the looks, everything.  The lighting is very subtle and works beautifully with the composition of your subjects.</td>', 'This is just a very cool shot.  Love the "setup", the looks, everything.  The lighting is very subtle and works beautifully with the composition of your subjects.', '2003-06-22 00:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(334504, 24841, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very nice, with lots of "mood", and  I really like a nice "contrasty" type of shot.  I''m not sure about the black on black thing, but nevertheless, like this shot quite well.</td>', 'Very nice, with lots of "mood", and  I really like a nice "contrasty" type of shot.  I''m not sure about the black on black thing, but nevertheless, like this shot quite well.', '2003-06-22 00:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(334507, 25473, 2553, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the title, and don''t think it matches the shot.  I like your lighting and your composition, and your focus is terrific.</td>', 'Don''t care for the title, and don''t think it matches the shot.  I like your lighting and your composition, and your focus is terrific.', '2003-06-22 00:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334509, 24919, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Don''t know about black on black, but definitely low-key.  Just enough contrast to get a feel for her face, but dark enough to still be kind of soft, moody, and mysterious.  Definitely a lovely shot.</td>', 'I love this shot.  Don''t know about black on black, but definitely low-key.  Just enough contrast to get a feel for her face, but dark enough to still be kind of soft, moody, and mysterious.  Definitely a lovely shot.', '2003-06-22 00:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(334510, 24957, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful!  Lighting and composition seem to work wonderfully.  This is one of my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'This is just beautiful!  Lighting and composition seem to work wonderfully.  This is one of my favorites this challenge.', '2003-06-22 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(334512, 24749, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious feel to this.  I like the composition, and the lighting on your subject.  There''s just enough light to see the main part of the subject, but your eyes keep looking at the "not so well lit" parts to try to discern more.</td>', 'Very mysterious feel to this.  I like the composition, and the lighting on your subject.  There''s just enough light to see the main part of the subject, but your eyes keep looking at the "not so well lit" parts to try to discern more.', '2003-06-22 00:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(334515, 25565, 8829, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. How about giving us the "how I did it" on this one?</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. How about giving us the "how I did it" on this one?', '2003-06-22 00:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(334516, 24878, 2553, '<td valign="top">A fabulous portrait!  This is simply a wonderful shot.  So much emotion conveyed in this photo.  Composition and lighting are amazing.  I bow to your talent!</td>', 'A fabulous portrait!  This is simply a wonderful shot.  So much emotion conveyed in this photo.  Composition and lighting are amazing.  I bow to your talent!', '2003-06-22 00:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334517, 25440, 2553, '<td valign="top">I honestly see nothing at all but a black square.  Perhaps you meant it that way.  Doesn''t do a lot for me.  Sorry.</td>', 'I honestly see nothing at all but a black square.  Perhaps you meant it that way.  Doesn''t do a lot for me.  Sorry.', '2003-06-22 00:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(334518, 25463, 2553, '<td valign="top">I can barely make out a few pixels that are a TINY bit lighter than the black.  Basically this is just a black box, as I see it.  Not much impact visually for me!</td>', 'I can barely make out a few pixels that are a TINY bit lighter than the black.  Basically this is just a black box, as I see it.  Not much impact visually for me!', '2003-06-22 00:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334526, 25070, 8953, '<td valign="top">Well this has been an EGGucation for sure...I''ve decided to come back through and re-review images. I had given you an 8 but you did such a good job with the task more a 9</td>', 'Well this has been an EGGucation for sure...I''ve decided to come back through and re-review images. I had given you an 8 but you did such a good job with the task more a 9', '2003-06-22 01:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
