(334599, 25559, 5585, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge...</td>', 'meets the challenge...', '2003-06-22 04:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(334600, 25087, 5585, '<td valign="top">challenge met.... I like it</td>', 'challenge met.... I like it', '2003-06-22 04:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(334601, 25421, 5585, '<td valign="top">does it for me....a winner</td>', 'does it for me....a winner', '2003-06-22 04:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(334615, 25496, 3585, '<td valign="top">Elegant architectural evocation. 8</td>', 'Elegant architectural evocation. 8', '2003-06-22 06:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334617, 25392, 3585, '<td valign="top">Smart idea, carefully and skilfully done. I am not sur all of us will see the tie, perhaps just a micro tad to dark. 9<br/>In the course of my life, the people that have appeared to me as the most blatantly disrespectfull of all were all tie barers. let us find alternate ways of showing it.</td>', 'Smart idea, carefully and skilfully done. I am not sur all of us will see the tie, perhaps just a micro tad to dark. 9In the course of my life, the people that have appeared to me as the most blatantly disrespectfull of all were all tie barers. let us find alternate ways of showing it.', '2003-06-22 06:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(334618, 25440, 3585, '<td valign="top">Had to import this one on photoshop to find out what it was all about. Not a bad picture but you were realy a little heavy handed on the black that day.</td>', 'Had to import this one on photoshop to find out what it was all about. Not a bad picture but you were realy a little heavy handed on the black that day.', '2003-06-22 06:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(334656, 25422, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the line created by theleft side of the model''s  face and down through the neck. I think a small light on the model''s right to define the head and not so strong on the  model''s left would be more in keeping with challenge. But a very good shot.</td>', 'I like the line created by theleft side of the model''s  face and down through the neck. I think a small light on the model''s right to define the head and not so strong on the  model''s left would be more in keeping with challenge. But a very good shot.', '2003-06-22 09:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(334661, 25135, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good potential in the subject. I think blacker background and side lighting would have made this a better shot.</td>', 'Good potential in the subject. I think blacker background and side lighting would have made this a better shot.', '2003-06-22 09:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(334664, 25480, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good subject. The post processing really distracts - the black area around the bottom looks splotchy and there is this twirly thing to the right and center of the boot.</td>', 'Good subject. The post processing really distracts - the black area around the bottom looks splotchy and there is this twirly thing to the right and center of the boot.', '2003-06-22 09:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(334665, 25565, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like this. The two old wheels give anice structure and the lighter leaves seem to stand out of the page.</td>', 'I like this. The two old wheels give anice structure and the lighter leaves seem to stand out of the page.', '2003-06-22 09:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(334667, 25126, 6405, '<td valign="top">This one is the best pic IMO,10 from me!</td>', 'This one is the best pic IMO,10 from me!', '2003-06-22 09:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(334801, 25495, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, especially the subtle folds in the background. The rose looks like it''s made of plastic, though! I love the composition and lighting add mystery to everything. Nice work.</td>', 'I like this idea, especially the subtle folds in the background. The rose looks like it''s made of plastic, though! I love the composition and lighting add mystery to everything. Nice work.', '2003-06-22 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(334804, 25579, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey, gloves! Hmmm. I have to admit that lighting does add interest to these gloves, and a sense of mystery. I''ll go for that!</td>', 'Hey, gloves! Hmmm. I have to admit that lighting does add interest to these gloves, and a sense of mystery. I''ll go for that!', '2003-06-22 13:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(334805, 24749, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work! Cool special effects. The sense of context you''ve built is genius! 9</td>', 'Nice work! Cool special effects. The sense of context you''ve built is genius! 9', '2003-06-22 13:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(334808, 25440, 6870, '<td valign="top">Darkness really add a strong mood to this photo! Nice work. Even with the BoB challenge, this may be a little dark, but I like it.</td>', 'Darkness really add a strong mood to this photo! Nice work. Even with the BoB challenge, this may be a little dark, but I like it.', '2003-06-22 13:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(334809, 25465, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yes, very clever! I''m not sure the darkness adds to the photo in terms of mood or effect, but you certainly communicate your visual pun very effectively.</td>', 'Yes, very clever! I''m not sure the darkness adds to the photo in terms of mood or effect, but you certainly communicate your visual pun very effectively.', '2003-06-22 13:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(334810, 25560, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view. Darkness fits your apt title!</td>', 'Nice point of view. Darkness fits your apt title!', '2003-06-22 13:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334811, 25574, 6870, '<td valign="top">In this image, darkness enhances the sense of mystery about what is behind the lock. Well used challenge topic! Nicely done, too. 9</td>', 'In this image, darkness enhances the sense of mystery about what is behind the lock. Well used challenge topic! Nicely done, too. 9', '2003-06-22 13:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(334812, 25471, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay Dmitri, I understand your complaint, but this cropping works so well, putting our attention on the sense of strength and struggle here rather than on other "things." Very nice work! 9</td>', 'Okay Dmitri, I understand your complaint, but this cropping works so well, putting our attention on the sense of strength and struggle here rather than on other "things." Very nice work! 9', '2003-06-22 13:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334816, 25577, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lighting and composition are wonderfulhere, as is focus. Oddly, the darkness doesn''t seem to add to this photo''s interest. It still remains a desk phone. Perhaps a different point of view would heighten the drama? Still, nicely done.</td>', 'Lighting and composition are wonderfulhere, as is focus. Oddly, the darkness doesn''t seem to add to this photo''s interest. It still remains a desk phone. Perhaps a different point of view would heighten the drama? Still, nicely done.', '2003-06-22 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(334817, 25447, 6870, '<td valign="top">For some time, I couldn''t tell what these were, so it may actually be too dark, but I still love this shot and the idea behind it. COmposition is great and the close crop indicates a wider world than is in your image.</td>', 'For some time, I couldn''t tell what these were, so it may actually be too dark, but I still love this shot and the idea behind it. COmposition is great and the close crop indicates a wider world than is in your image.', '2003-06-22 13:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(334819, 25421, 6870, '<td valign="top">The expression of the face of this lovely model fits your title well and goes well with the darkness required in the challenge.</td>', 'The expression of the face of this lovely model fits your title well and goes well with the darkness required in the challenge.', '2003-06-22 13:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(334822, 24902, 6870, '<td valign="top">First of all, I like this photo a lot! The darkness really adds mood and texture to this statue. The net result, however, does not say "dignity" to me, but rather something far more mysterious, but not quite ominous. It''s thought provoking nature makes it, in my opinion, a very nice shot with the wrong title. Nice work!</td>', 'First of all, I like this photo a lot! The darkness really adds mood and texture to this statue. The net result, however, does not say "dignity" to me, but rather something far more mysterious, but not quite ominous. It''s thought provoking nature makes it, in my opinion, a very nice shot with the wrong title. Nice work!', '2003-06-22 13:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(334823, 25363, 6870, '<td valign="top">This shot works well for me: the expression, the cigarrette, the darkness--all add up to a nice photo that keeps us guessing just enough. 8</td>', 'This shot works well for me: the expression, the cigarrette, the darkness--all add up to a nice photo that keeps us guessing just enough. 8', '2003-06-22 13:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(334824, 24822, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice work. The lighting matches the mask so well, and it was a stroke of genius to add that net (or a stroke of luck if it were already there!). Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice work. The lighting matches the mask so well, and it was a stroke of genius to add that net (or a stroke of luck if it were already there!). Nice job.', '2003-06-22 13:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334827, 24893, 6870, '<td valign="top">The low light here really enhances the mood. The still water and gentle lines really help too. Nice work.</td>', 'The low light here really enhances the mood. The still water and gentle lines really help too. Nice work.', '2003-06-22 13:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(334841, 25386, 554, '<td valign="top">Do you know her?</td>', 'Do you know her?', '2003-06-22 14:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(334989, 24957, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!!!  I was expecting to see a cat when I saw the title.  This is a lovely model and well photographed.  Best of luck!</td>', 'Beautiful image!!!  I was expecting to see a cat when I saw the title.  This is a lovely model and well photographed.  Best of luck!', '2003-06-22 20:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
