(336500, 24902, 9437, '<td valign="top">This is the essence of B-on-B (aka Low Key) photography. It gets my vote for #1</td>', 'This is the essence of B-on-B (aka Low Key) photography. It gets my vote for #1', '2003-06-24 16:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(336693, 25422, 4811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, lighting and expression! I ;ole how just a small amount of light was thrown on the hair so you could make out some of it.  Framing is what really hurts an otherwise perfect image... why did you center this in a landscape format? A better choice would be to either position her in the leftmost third of the frame, having her look inward, or use a portrait orientation and have her face fill most of the frame. Pay attention to the edges also, you cut off a snippet of the neck :)</td>', 'Wonderful, lighting and expression! I ;ole how just a small amount of light was thrown on the hair so you could make out some of it.  Framing is what really hurts an otherwise perfect image... why did you center this in a landscape format? A better choice would be to either position her in the leftmost third of the frame, having her look inward, or use a portrait orientation and have her face fill most of the frame. Pay attention to the edges also, you cut off a snippet of the neck :)', '2003-06-24 21:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(336751, 25440, 4811, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve already comments stating the photo is too dark, or to some monitors, appears to have nothing there at all... I did a levels adjustment in Photoshop to be able to see the image, and I find it a really compelling portrait that could have done well - if only it could be seen.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve already comments stating the photo is too dark, or to some monitors, appears to have nothing there at all... I did a levels adjustment in Photoshop to be able to see the image, and I find it a really compelling portrait that could have done well - if only it could be seen.', '2003-06-24 22:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(336778, 25428, 7838, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I like this a lot.  I think the dented Ace gives the picture character.  Possibly the back upper cards a bit too out of focus, but i like very much.<br/></td>', 'Very cool.  I like this a lot.  I think the dented Ace gives the picture character.  Possibly the back upper cards a bit too out of focus, but i like very much.', '2003-06-24 23:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(336779, 25386, 7838, '<td valign="top">almost perfectly shot.  I don''t know about the person in the underwear at bottom right, but nonetheless, pretty well done</td>', 'almost perfectly shot.  I don''t know about the person in the underwear at bottom right, but nonetheless, pretty well done', '2003-06-24 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(336782, 24946, 7838, '<td valign="top">very nice.  i like the border</td>', 'very nice.  i like the border', '2003-06-24 23:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(336795, 24749, 7838, '<td valign="top">toooo weird...... neat concept</td>', 'toooo weird...... neat concept', '2003-06-24 23:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(336958, 25516, 7711, '<td valign="top">i like the composition, but detail is lost through the grain (which I don''t think is adding something valuable to the shot)</td>', 'i like the composition, but detail is lost through the grain (which I don''t think is adding something valuable to the shot)', '2003-06-25 01:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(337458, 25428, 9608, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and composition.</td>', 'Nice detail and composition.', '2003-06-25 09:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(337628, 25036, 6661, '<td valign="top">I Love it.. what a great looking couple.</td>', 'I Love it.. what a great looking couple.', '2003-06-25 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(338100, 25440, 4517, '<td valign="top">I like that you can only just see him. A lot will say too dark but it`s very deliberate.9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-27 12:32:29.</i></td>', 'I like that you can only just see him. A lot will say too dark but it`s very deliberate.9', '2003-06-25 17:28:10.000000', '2003-06-27 13:32:29.000000', 1),
(338114, 25087, 312, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting shot, but i''m not really diggin'' it. the soft focus and in-your-face framing don''t offer a lot to look at, and overall there is not much contrast to the shot, making it kind of muddied and dark. 5.</td>', 'this is an interesting shot, but i''m not really diggin'' it. the soft focus and in-your-face framing don''t offer a lot to look at, and overall there is not much contrast to the shot, making it kind of muddied and dark. 5.', '2003-06-25 17:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(338115, 25436, 312, '<td valign="top">this is definitely the kind of contrast i was looking for in this challenge. the bright highlights work really well here to outline and abstract the subject. my only gripe is that i think it''d like to see the background be completely black (though not quite as black as the latex). the part of the background that goes to gray on the left side kind of unbalances the image a bit. good work overall. 8.</td>', 'this is definitely the kind of contrast i was looking for in this challenge. the bright highlights work really well here to outline and abstract the subject. my only gripe is that i think it''d like to see the background be completely black (though not quite as black as the latex). the part of the background that goes to gray on the left side kind of unbalances the image a bit. good work overall. 8.', '2003-06-25 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(338118, 24819, 312, '<td valign="top">hey, i have this controller. heh. i think this shot is a good attempt, but maybe a closer-up abstract of just the black buttons and the reflections and contours they have to offer would have worked better. the large areas of gray in the middle of the controller are rather uninteresting as is. 5.</td>', 'hey, i have this controller. heh. i think this shot is a good attempt, but maybe a closer-up abstract of just the black buttons and the reflections and contours they have to offer would have worked better. the large areas of gray in the middle of the controller are rather uninteresting as is. 5.', '2003-06-25 17:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(338121, 25547, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot, though i think you''ve cluttered it a bit by including the "marshall" insignia. i''ve seen shots of guitars similar to this that really work by showing the great curves and smooth finish using high contrast focused lighting. you''ve started to explore that here with the guitar, but the shot''s overall "focus" gets lost when you include the logo. 4.</td>', 'this is a nice shot, though i think you''ve cluttered it a bit by including the "marshall" insignia. i''ve seen shots of guitars similar to this that really work by showing the great curves and smooth finish using high contrast focused lighting. you''ve started to explore that here with the guitar, but the shot''s overall "focus" gets lost when you include the logo. 4.', '2003-06-25 17:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(338124, 24902, 9411, '<td valign="top">I like the composition<br/></td>', 'I like the composition', '2003-06-25 17:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(338126, 24766, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a good shot with a lot of underlying emotion. the blank and introspective stares of each individual seems to show a little about their mood, and i like that. framing is good and the diagonal composition is very nice. i''d like to see maybe a little more high contrast lighting on the people, but overall this is a really nice shot. good work. 8.</td>', 'this is a good shot with a lot of underlying emotion. the blank and introspective stares of each individual seems to show a little about their mood, and i like that. framing is good and the diagonal composition is very nice. i''d like to see maybe a little more high contrast lighting on the people, but overall this is a really nice shot. good work. 8.', '2003-06-25 17:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(338128, 25514, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a good study of abstract shapes and forms, and the contrast is good for this type of photography, but i''m afraid the subject doesn''t really do much for me. 6.</td>', 'this is a good study of abstract shapes and forms, and the contrast is good for this type of photography, but i''m afraid the subject doesn''t really do much for me. 6.', '2003-06-25 17:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(338132, 25563, 312, '<td valign="top">i don''t like the framing of this shot much at all. you''ve cropped off a lot of the subjects and it kind of looks awkward. lighting is decent, but i would try to boost the contrast a bit with some more directed, brighter light. 4.</td>', 'i don''t like the framing of this shot much at all. you''ve cropped off a lot of the subjects and it kind of looks awkward. lighting is decent, but i would try to boost the contrast a bit with some more directed, brighter light. 4.', '2003-06-25 17:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(338134, 25368, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot. my only gripe here would be that the skin tones lack tonal range. i''d love to see some more hotspots or high-contrast lighting (i''ve said this on a lot of the pictures i''ve commented on this challenge, but i really like higher contrast when working in low-key). other than that, i think this is worthy of a frame. the use of negative space to outline the countours of his face is great. good work. 8.</td>', 'this is a nice shot. my only gripe here would be that the skin tones lack tonal range. i''d love to see some more hotspots or high-contrast lighting (i''ve said this on a lot of the pictures i''ve commented on this challenge, but i really like higher contrast when working in low-key). other than that, i think this is worthy of a frame. the use of negative space to outline the countours of his face is great. good work. 8.', '2003-06-25 17:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(338135, 24960, 312, '<td valign="top">this has the workings of a really nice shot, but something about the crop bothers me. it seems to be too weighted toward the left side of the frame and i feel like it''s unbalanced. the lighting and contrasts are great, and the stone has really great tones and textures. i just think a different crop of this would be a lot nicer. good effort. 6.</td>', 'this has the workings of a really nice shot, but something about the crop bothers me. it seems to be too weighted toward the left side of the frame and i feel like it''s unbalanced. the lighting and contrasts are great, and the stone has really great tones and textures. i just think a different crop of this would be a lot nicer. good effort. 6.', '2003-06-25 18:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(338140, 25561, 312, '<td valign="top">good control of light here. i''m not really floored by the subject or anything, but technically this is pretty good. maybe a less dramatic angle would look a little better, allowing you to get more of those eyes in the shot rather than just the extreme highlights. i like the highlights on the whiskers in the bottom right. 5.</td>', 'good control of light here. i''m not really floored by the subject or anything, but technically this is pretty good. maybe a less dramatic angle would look a little better, allowing you to get more of those eyes in the shot rather than just the extreme highlights. i like the highlights on the whiskers in the bottom right. 5.', '2003-06-25 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(338142, 25557, 312, '<td valign="top">good lighting and contrast. your hand looks really tense and awkward. this photo kind of gives me a weird feeling. heh. i think it would also work better if you took off the watch or whatever it is on your wrist in the corner. technically, a very nice shot. 6.</td>', 'good lighting and contrast. your hand looks really tense and awkward. this photo kind of gives me a weird feeling. heh. i think it would also work better if you took off the watch or whatever it is on your wrist in the corner. technically, a very nice shot. 6.', '2003-06-25 18:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(338146, 25577, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a good setup. i like the highlights and curve of the cord, but the contrast on the phone itself is very muddy. i find myself commenting on a lot of "boring" subjects in this challenge. i guess people wanted to practice the technique more than bother finding interesting photographs, which i can''t really fault them for. you''ve done well with the technique. 6.</td>', 'this is a good setup. i like the highlights and curve of the cord, but the contrast on the phone itself is very muddy. i find myself commenting on a lot of "boring" subjects in this challenge. i guess people wanted to practice the technique more than bother finding interesting photographs, which i can''t really fault them for. you''ve done well with the technique. 6.', '2003-06-25 18:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(338149, 25447, 312, '<td valign="top">this is very dark and muddy. you can''t really tell what you''re looking at unless you give it a good hard look. i''d like to see more contrast / hard light off the ball in order to bring some of it''s curves to life. 4.</td>', 'this is very dark and muddy. you can''t really tell what you''re looking at unless you give it a good hard look. i''d like to see more contrast / hard light off the ball in order to bring some of it''s curves to life. 4.', '2003-06-25 18:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(338153, 25518, 312, '<td valign="top">this has the makings of a really interesting shot. so many great surfaces and curves and highlights, but this image is really dark. i''d really love to see the lighting and contrast kicked up a notch to really bring out the subtleties of the instrument. 6.</td>', 'this has the makings of a really interesting shot. so many great surfaces and curves and highlights, but this image is really dark. i''d really love to see the lighting and contrast kicked up a notch to really bring out the subtleties of the instrument. 6.', '2003-06-25 18:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(338156, 24891, 312, '<td valign="top">if this was a real human, this would be such a great shot. heh. the lighting and contrast is perfect, thought it does kind of border on being not really low-key. it''s more of a straight on black and white. if the background were just a bit blacker, you''d be more into the low-key frame of mind (in my opinion). a good shot, nonetheless. 7.</td>', 'if this was a real human, this would be such a great shot. heh. the lighting and contrast is perfect, thought it does kind of border on being not really low-key. it''s more of a straight on black and white. if the background were just a bit blacker, you''d be more into the low-key frame of mind (in my opinion). a good shot, nonetheless. 7.', '2003-06-25 18:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(338159, 24688, 312, '<td valign="top">it''s crooked. attention to detail can make or break a shot like this, and you''ve broken it. heh. decent lighting, good focus. i wouldn''t mind seeing this with a shallower depth of field to maybe blur out some of the top of the speaker and give it a real sense of depth. 5.</td>', 'it''s crooked. attention to detail can make or break a shot like this, and you''ve broken it. heh. decent lighting, good focus. i wouldn''t mind seeing this with a shallower depth of field to maybe blur out some of the top of the speaker and give it a real sense of depth. 5.', '2003-06-25 18:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(338163, 24770, 312, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting and contrast. i think this really captures the essence of "low-key". the tree on the right keeps this image from being too centered, which i like. i''d love to see some more abstract, close-up, angled shots of this statue, because it has a lot of nice textures and tones to offer. good work. 7.</td>', 'very nice lighting and contrast. i think this really captures the essence of "low-key". the tree on the right keeps this image from being too centered, which i like. i''d love to see some more abstract, close-up, angled shots of this statue, because it has a lot of nice textures and tones to offer. good work. 7.', '2003-06-25 18:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(338166, 25480, 312, '<td valign="top">pretty good light, very boring subject. the boot could probably use a good shine to get more contrast and dynamics in the light. 5.</td>', 'pretty good light, very boring subject. the boot could probably use a good shine to get more contrast and dynamics in the light. 5.', '2003-06-25 18:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(338168, 25422, 312, '<td valign="top">this would be much better if the subject were not centered. i don''t like to play like i care too much about photographic "standards", but the "rule of thirds" could really make this image come alive. the lighting and contrast are great. 6.</td>', 'this would be much better if the subject were not centered. i don''t like to play like i care too much about photographic "standards", but the "rule of thirds" could really make this image come alive. the lighting and contrast are great. 6.', '2003-06-25 18:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(338170, 25386, 312, '<td valign="top">funny. is this an edit or an actual image? not much to really say about this. it''s a good shot. 6.</td>', 'funny. is this an edit or an actual image? not much to really say about this. it''s a good shot. 6.', '2003-06-25 18:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(338257, 25569, 6458, '<td valign="top">I love this. Brilliant!  1.     <br/> <br/> <br/>ok. I''m just kidding. this is definitely a 10. It looks like it''s a drawing, a really black sketch. Almost out of a cartoon. I love the textures. It''s all good!</td>', 'I love this. Brilliant!  1.       ok. I''m just kidding. this is definitely a 10. It looks like it''s a drawing, a really black sketch. Almost out of a cartoon. I love the textures. It''s all good!', '2003-06-25 19:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(338318, 25174, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in the challenge.  I love how the arches fill the composition.  I like the long passage way to the right with the sunlight making steps on the floor,  The details in the stones of the arches are great.  I''d crop the bottom to get rid of the half included spot of sun - or include it entirely.  Why is the base of the pillar blue?  I love the ancient feel the pic gives - good subject for black on black.  9</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in the challenge.  I love how the arches fill the composition.  I like the long passage way to the right with the sunlight making steps on the floor,  The details in the stones of the arches are great.  I''d crop the bottom to get rid of the half included spot of sun - or include it entirely.  Why is the base of the pillar blue?  I love the ancient feel the pic gives - good subject for black on black.  9', '2003-06-25 20:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(338335, 25421, 6900, '<td valign="top">Except for the lighter colored black addition, this looks good. Actually it looks like my gf, really.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=25307" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=25307</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-28 17:25:00.</i></td>', 'Except for the lighter colored black addition, this looks good. Actually it looks like my gf, really. //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=25307', '2003-06-25 20:46:11.000000', '2003-06-28 18:25:00.000000', 1),
(338337, 25126, 6900, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2003-06-25 20:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(338339, 25440, 6900, '<td valign="top">What a great low key shot.  Should be the winner, but won''t be.  10</td>', 'What a great low key shot.  Should be the winner, but won''t be.  10', '2003-06-25 20:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(338340, 24957, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great model, good lighting.  8</td>', 'Great model, good lighting.  8', '2003-06-25 20:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(338349, 25516, 7628, '<td valign="top">A very peaceful image - the dim grays lend themselves well to the theme.  I think it would look better with the illuminated backdrop less clear - either ironed (I hate ironing anything!) or perhaps out of focus?  The central subject in well done - I like the graininess, and just enough light and definition to be easily recognizeable.</td>', 'A very peaceful image - the dim grays lend themselves well to the theme.  I think it would look better with the illuminated backdrop less clear - either ironed (I hate ironing anything!) or perhaps out of focus?  The central subject in well done - I like the graininess, and just enough light and definition to be easily recognizeable.', '2003-06-25 21:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(338350, 25241, 7628, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure I''d call this black on black - but there seems to be some confusion about the challenge anyway.  I like the smoke against the blackness (where have I seen that before? lol) You''ve captured some delicate yet well defined wisps.  I might crop in a bit.</td>', 'I''m not really sure I''d call this black on black - but there seems to be some confusion about the challenge anyway.  I like the smoke against the blackness (where have I seen that before? lol) You''ve captured some delicate yet well defined wisps.  I might crop in a bit.', '2003-06-25 21:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(338351, 24995, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of a dim light illuminating the objects surrounding it - hoever I can''t see enough of this "forest" to know what it is, and the shapes, textures and details  themselves don''t draw the eye.  Perhaps another light source below or behind to give us just a bit more information?</td>', 'I like the idea of a dim light illuminating the objects surrounding it - hoever I can''t see enough of this "forest" to know what it is, and the shapes, textures and details  themselves don''t draw the eye.  Perhaps another light source below or behind to give us just a bit more information?', '2003-06-25 21:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(338353, 24902, 9604, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture with great visual impact!</td>', 'Wonderful picture with great visual impact!', '2003-06-25 21:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(338354, 24888, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - good subject.  The light moulds the shapes nicely.  The brights are just a bit bright however, and it is a bit disconcerting that we cannot see his other arm or the rest of hers.  A deeper DOF woldbring the near hand into focus.</td>', 'Nice idea - good subject.  The light moulds the shapes nicely.  The brights are just a bit bright however, and it is a bit disconcerting that we cannot see his other arm or the rest of hers.  A deeper DOF woldbring the near hand into focus.', '2003-06-25 21:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(338357, 25440, 7628, '<td valign="top">This pic intrigues me.  The thumbnail looks almost all black.  I enjoy seeing the face appear out of the darkness when I see it close.  You get a lot of detail for such little light, but it is still just too dark for me.</td>', 'This pic intrigues me.  The thumbnail looks almost all black.  I enjoy seeing the face appear out of the darkness when I see it close.  You get a lot of detail for such little light, but it is still just too dark for me.', '2003-06-25 21:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(338358, 25471, 1717, '<td valign="top">sigh...oh my!  great image...the lighting and composition are really nice.  leaves something to the imagination.  i''m glad i have a good imagination! ;)</td>', 'sigh...oh my!  great image...the lighting and composition are really nice.  leaves something to the imagination.  i''m glad i have a good imagination! ;)', '2003-06-25 21:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(338361, 25470, 1717, '<td valign="top">lovely!  nice lighting and composition!  good job!</td>', 'lovely!  nice lighting and composition!  good job!', '2003-06-25 21:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(338362, 25522, 9604, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Just enough highlights to see the whole subject.</td>', 'Great shot! Just enough highlights to see the whole subject.', '2003-06-25 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(338365, 24766, 1717, '<td valign="top">i really love this pic...the facial expressions are awesome!  lighting and composition are great.  good job!</td>', 'i really love this pic...the facial expressions are awesome!  lighting and composition are great.  good job!', '2003-06-25 21:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(338367, 25248, 9604, '<td valign="top">Good job with just enough light to do the job.</td>', 'Good job with just enough light to do the job.', '2003-06-25 21:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
