(338370, 24957, 7628, '<td valign="top">A dramatic portrait.  I wish it extended down more - so we could see the entire neckline of her dress.  Wish also that the background were completely black - at least air=brush out the wrinkles.</td>', 'A dramatic portrait.  I wish it extended down more - so we could see the entire neckline of her dress.  Wish also that the background were completely black - at least air=brush out the wrinkles.', '2003-06-25 21:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(338372, 25174, 1717, '<td valign="top">wow!  this is stunning!  the lighting is awesome and i love how it leads my eye to the light from the window.  excellent work!</td>', 'wow!  this is stunning!  the lighting is awesome and i love how it leads my eye to the light from the window.  excellent work!', '2003-06-25 21:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
