(339728, 24822, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Very haunting image has a very spooky feeling about it.  The focus is very good and the lighting very appropriate for this image.  Nice how the veil disappears into the darkness.<br/> <br/>One thing I really find distrubing in the entire image is that little ornament on the hat near the top on the rightside.  It is almost as if it there a leading line and when your eye follows it there is nothing to look at. Other than that it really is a very neat image.  Well done and definately meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* Very haunting image has a very spooky feeling about it.  The focus is very good and the lighting very appropriate for this image.  Nice how the veil disappears into the darkness. One thing I really find distrubing in the entire image is that little ornament on the hat near the top on the rightside.  It is almost as if it there a leading line and when your eye follows it there is nothing to look at. Other than that it really is a very neat image.  Well done and definately meets the challenge. Anna', '2003-06-27 01:16:22.000000', NULL, 0),
