(339800, 25436, 4564, '<td valign="top">Missed a spot in the top 3 by a hair for the second time... LOL!!!  <br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for the nice comments. I understand my photography can be weird or provocative to some on DPC, and I take this rank 4 as a great compliment from everybody.<br/> <br/>To answer some of the questions, this is a real model wearing a latex catsuit, gloves and hood.  The model can breathe through holes at her nostrils.  I photoshoped them out to add to the "doll illusion".  I did this photo for DPC and not for any other project.  I wanted to experiment with the B&amp;W and create a special atmosphere with the low-key technique and this model in latex.  The suit is black.  The background too.  Big main source light on the left (6 foot softbox flash) and one backlight on the right.  <br/>We shot for 30 minutes.  After that, the model was exhausted.  It''s not easy to shoot in this outfit, blind... and it can get very warm during these summer days.<br/> <br/>Martin<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-27 01:57:50.</i></td>', 'Missed a spot in the top 3 by a hair for the second time... LOL!!!   Thanks everyone for the nice comments. I understand my photography can be weird or provocative to some on DPC, and I take this rank 4 as a great compliment from everybody. To answer some of the questions, this is a real model wearing a latex catsuit, gloves and hood.  The model can breathe through holes at her nostrils.  I photoshoped them out to add to the "doll illusion".  I did this photo for DPC and not for any other project.  I wanted to experiment with the B&W and create a special atmosphere with the low-key technique and this model in latex.  The suit is black.  The background too.  Big main source light on the left (6 foot softbox flash) and one backlight on the right.  We shot for 30 minutes.  After that, the model was exhausted.  It''s not easy to shoot in this outfit, blind... and it can get very warm during these summer days. Martin', '2003-06-27 02:44:42.000000', '2003-06-27 02:57:50.000000', 0),
(339861, 24946, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well, 8thplace isn''t bad, but this was my number 1 shot and only 10. I hope you''re pleased with it. Please let me know if you make it into a print!</td>', 'Well, 8thplace isn''t bad, but this was my number 1 shot and only 10. I hope you''re pleased with it. Please let me know if you make it into a print!', '2003-06-27 03:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
