(340144, 25428, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>If that one card I can''t make out is a Q you got a great hand there.  If you are playing poker I''m glad I''m not at the table =o)  The dof used here works nicely, the focus is very good but what I don''t like is there is just a little bit to much light for this challenge and not enough shadowing.  Nice composition and yeah even with to much light it still is obvious it was done in low light so it does meet the challenge.<br/> <br/>Anna<br/></td>', 'Critique Club If that one card I can''t make out is a Q you got a great hand there.  If you are playing poker I''m glad I''m not at the table =o)  The dof used here works nicely, the focus is very good but what I don''t like is there is just a little bit to much light for this challenge and not enough shadowing.  Nice composition and yeah even with to much light it still is obvious it was done in low light so it does meet the challenge. Anna', '2003-06-27 09:42:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(340163, 25250, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/> <br/>Overall this is a really nice still life photo, the composition is good and the use of black and white works well.  Now in all honesty though it is far to bright for a low key photo.  Darkening the entire image would have made it work well, cause you already have some shadowing its just to bright for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Your focus is very good and strong and makes the photo work, it just didn''t work with this challenge.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club*  Overall this is a really nice still life photo, the composition is good and the use of black and white works well.  Now in all honesty though it is far to bright for a low key photo.  Darkening the entire image would have made it work well, cause you already have some shadowing its just to bright for this challenge. Your focus is very good and strong and makes the photo work, it just didn''t work with this challenge. Anna', '2003-06-27 09:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(340210, 25440, 2221, '<td valign="top">If people couldn''t see something they really should fix their monitor settings. I can see your son very good. And I like your technique! It makes the photo interesting. The face of your son expresses a somewhat darker mood and the very dark lighting goes with that.</td>', 'If people couldn''t see something they really should fix their monitor settings. I can see your son very good. And I like your technique! It makes the photo interesting. The face of your son expresses a somewhat darker mood and the very dark lighting goes with that.', '2003-06-27 10:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
